<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HALLE, Germany 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results at</p>
<p>the $875,000 German grass-court men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>7-Michael Stich (Germany) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-3 3-6 7-6 (9-7)</p>
</text>
